{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/30021f15ca1570514df9d497118104ab.avif?t=1761849830\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fields of Mine is a roguelike puzzle where classic Minesweeper turns into an unpredictable adventure. Each new field breaks the familiar rules and challenges your attention, logic, and ability to adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/76bad7f335c6d820a238508fdfea774b.avif?t=1761849830\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/7ef6b7caab9b0e5b76777198c912bc20.avif?t=1761849830\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, numbers may show not the count of mines but the number of safe tiles. Here, tiles themselves can become traps. Every level twists the usual laws of the game and forces you to find unconventional moves to survive under constantly changing rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/2ddb587ed2fd475eddd35abe5cc22e2b.avif?t=1761849830\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/829e169f572b618eb9560540e3ab31e4.avif?t=1761849830\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchants, random events, and unexpected mechanic combinations turn every run into a unique trial. Sometimes luck is on your side, but more often it\u2019s your calculation and foresight that decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/02d37cf429cd7e760df7e6567f00620f.avif?t=1761849830\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/95e70ad52bcc5223625178a8000e8128.avif?t=1761849830\" width=616 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, failure is inevitable. But mistakes open new horizons. Each attempt makes you more experienced, and every setback brings you closer to the moment when even the most cunning rule combinations stop being insurmountable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/extras/d66c302a715a67cfa269aa8788886094.avif?t=1761849830\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722690?t=1761849830","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722690?t=1761849830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/ae313c7da6752272b650623ff3645cbf91976498/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761849830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722690/ae313c7da6752272b650623ff3645cbf91976498/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761849830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":n